{"5023790": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arcade Audience", "steam_appid": 5023790, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "dlc": [5162010], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023790/extras/6ce162c73fd3c60d80761cb1734b5b8d.avif?t=1788080893\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023790/extras_big/6ce162c73fd3c60d80761cb1734b5b8d.webp?t=1788080893 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Welcome to the Arcade! Whack the Moles to the rhythm to impress the audience and achieve arcade glory!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a self-titled professional Whack-a-Mole legend. And today's the day where you can finally show off your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, this isn't any old Whack-a-Mole. No no no. you don't understand, this is RHYTHM Whack-a-Mole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That means you need to hit the moles perfectly to the beat or you might just embarrass yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go for a high score on both levels! Plus, the optional Night Mode for the people that REALLY get it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Featuring:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 levels of arcadey rhythmic goodness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredible soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully hand-drawn art and animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun, replayable high score-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Mode for an extra challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, this game was made with PenguinMod. The art too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's face it- this game isn't very long. It's about 15 minutes at most if you don't want to go for high scores. However, it's free, so I digress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023790/extras/6ce162c73fd3c60d80761cb1734b5b8d.avif?t=1788080893\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023790/extras_big/6ce162c73fd3c60d80761cb1734b5b8d.webp?t=1788080893 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><u>Welcome to the Arcade! Whack the Moles to the rhythm to impress the audience and achieve arcade glory!</u></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are a self-titled professional Whack-a-Mole legend. And today's the day where you can finally show off your skills!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, this isn't any old Whack-a-Mole. No no no. you don't understand, this is RHYTHM Whack-a-Mole.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >That means you need to hit the moles perfectly to the beat or you might just embarrass yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go for a high score on both levels! Plus, the optional Night Mode for the people that REALLY get it!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><u>Featuring:</u></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2 levels of arcadey rhythmic goodness</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incredible soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fully hand-drawn art and animation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fun, replayable high score-based gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Night Mode for an extra challenge</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Yes, this game was made with PenguinMod. The art too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's face it- this game isn't very long. It's about 15 minutes at most if you don't want to go for high scores. However, it's free, so I digress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "The arcade is packed, and you're the reason! Hit the targets to the beat to impress the audience. Master the different timings and cues to achieve arcade perfection!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023790/93ea855847af0389fc982b87164e5c6075754735/header.jpg?t=1788080893", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023790/6bb701b5b613ff1c207ebfadbc97a3b94c1ae3b8/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1788080893", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5023790/6bb701b5b613ff1c207ebfadbc97a3b94c1ae3b8/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1788080893", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> No</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "developers": ["APTStudios"], "publishers": ["ATARA Productions"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}